gcVs(){return"Log into my.tax.gov.ir and navigate to Case Access > Enrollment > Tax Memory ID."},
gcVt(){return"Select \u201cBy taxpayer\u201d and upload the generated Public Key file."},
gcVu(){return"Copy the issued memory ID and paste it back into Hesabix."},
